        1409,
        1925,
        1589
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Your attention is directed to the Mayor's Executive Order No. 71, dated April 2, 1968 providing for Equal Employment Contract Compliance by all contractors accepting contracts with the City of New York. The Executive Order was published in the City Record of April 10, 1968.",
